This directory is a detached copy of https://github.com/lucamartinetti/wormhole-page
(commit d4730a0 of the dougsko/wormhole-page fork), licensed MIT by its author
Luca Martinetti. static/qr.js is "QR Code Generator for JavaScript" by Kazuhiko
Arase (MIT), unmodified.

The WebAssembly client links the magic-wormhole Rust library
(https://github.com/magic-wormhole/magic-wormhole.rs, via the fork pinned in
crates/wormhole-wasm/Cargo.toml), which is licensed EUPL-1.2, not MIT. The EUPL
text and source are available in that repository; anyone distributing the built
WebAssembly module must comply with the EUPL for that part.
